title: 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_영문
---
(I've been at school for four hours now, and I'm beyond exhausted.)
(Maybe I should hit the club room...)
<<wait 2>>
{name()}: Oh, ASan?
<<play san_sound>>
<<show san_spec>>
(Usually, the other kids are here. She's an unexpected face to see in the club room.)
(And she's actually playing the bass.)
<<play 공통_노크>>
<<wait 2>>
{name()}: What are you up to?
ASan: Oh, I'm practicing for the show next week.
<<show san_smile>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: So, how do I look? My bass-playing pose, I mean.
ASan: Even from 200 meters away, I look pretty iconic, don't I?
ASan: Want me to give you an autograph while I'm still reachable?
{name()}: ...I don't need an autograph!!!!
ASan: Don't be shy~~
ASan: For you, I'll S-P-E-C-I-A-L-L-Y include a personalized message~
{name()}: I'm good, thanks!!!!!!!!!
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: By the way, you've never actually heard me play, have you?
ASan: Want a listen?
<<wait 1>>
<<show san_idle>>
<<choice 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_긍정1_영문 "Sure, let's hear it." 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_부정1_영문 "Honestly, I'm just so tired..." true>>
ASan: Just so you know, I'm debuting this song at next week's show, so I can only give you about a 5-second teaser.
===

title: 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
(She looks so excited, I can't really say no.)
{name()}: Sure, let's hear it.
<<show san_blush>>
<<change lvSan 10>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Awesome!
<<show san_spec>>
<<play 베이스_소리>>
<<wait 3>>
<<show san_blush>>
ASan: Well? What do you think?
(Maybe because it's a bass, it mostly just sounded like a bunch of rhythmic 'clack-clack' noises...)
ASan: How was it?!??!???!?!?!?!?!?
{name()}: Whoa, it's got a really cool vibe.
{name()}: Uh... I mean, I think it's going to be a huge hit at the show next week, and...
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Thanks.
{name()}: ....Huh?
<<show san_neg2>>
ASan: I said thanks! Okay?!!!! Don't make me say it twice.
{name()}: Oh, okay... got it...
(After that, ASan kept bugging me and ruined my nap by offering to play all sorts of songs on her guitar.)
(I don't know if she realized I was sleepy, but it was kind of cute how she kept insisting on playing me a "lullaby.")
(...Now I'm actually curious about her show.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_부정1_영문
---
(I didn't show it to ASan, but I'm actually really drained..)
(If I listen to her play now, I might not be able to give her a proper reaction, which could be awkward..)
{name()}: Honestly, I'm just so tired...
<<show san_neg2>>
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: Oh. Fine.
ASan: It's not like I really wanted to play for you anyway.
(ASan starts grumpily packing her gig bag, muttering to herself just loud enough for me to hear.)
ASan: Says he doesn't need my autograph.
ASan: Says he doesn't want to hear my music.........
ASan: .......
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: Fine. I'm leaving.
ASan: Get. Some. Rest.
ASan: For. Ever.
(ASan slams the door shut as she leaves.)
<<choice 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_긍정2_영문 "Go after her." 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_부정2_영문 "Don't go after her.">>
(Should I go out and try to cheer her up?)
===

title: 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_긍정2_영문
---
(She's so upset, I can't just let her go like this.)
(I burst out the door and caught up with ASan as she was turning the corner.)
{name()}: ASan!!!!!!!
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: What.
(She sounds cold, but her eyes are red.)
(It looks like she was crying.)
{name()}: ......I'm sorry.
{name()}: It's not that I didn't want to hear you play. I was just up all night doing assignments and I'm exhausted.
{name()}: ......
{name()}: I know I'm being shameless, but... could you play for me some other time?
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: .....
ASan: I'll think about it.
ASan: Now, can you get out of my way?
(ASan left me standing all alone in the hallway.)
(I think I really messed up this time....)
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
<<end>>
===

title: 주4_목_3교시_동아리방_신아산_부정2_영문
---
(......)
(It can't be helped.)
(Sleep comes first.)
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
(And so, I fell asleep, leaving ASan to herself.)
<<wait 1>>
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
(Not even knowing that ASan was crying in the hallway.)
<<end>>
===